# Local secrets/config for the app Worker (copy to .dev.vars; .dev.vars is gitignored).
# The default setup is KEYLESS: Workers AI (@cf/zai-org/glm-4.7-flash) needs only
# `wrangler login`, no values here. Everything below is OPTIONAL.

# --- Per-role model overrides (CONTEXT.md §9) ---
# Leave unset to use the keyless Workers AI default for both roles.
# Documented fallback if glm is unreliable at tool calling: gpt-6-luna (OpenAI).
# MODEL_ORCHESTRATOR=gpt-6-luna
# MODEL_SPECIALIST=@cf/zai-org/glm-4.7-flash

# --- API keys for the fallback providers (only if you set the models above) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=...

# --- MCP server URL (defaults to the local dev MCP Worker) ---
# MCP_URL=http://localhost:8788/mcp
